    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d54">

                <pb facs="0115" n="103" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg103"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.636/1514c: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-03-05T13:00:00-04:00">March 5, 1944—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1680. Personal for the Ambassador. The press is beginning to speculate
                    unfavorably on a breakdown of proposed oil talks. It is <pb facs="0116" n="104"
                        xml:id="pg104"/> vital to make some announcement tomorrow. Please do all you
                    can to get an immediate decision.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
